---
pagination:
  data: agents
  size: 1
  alias: agent
permalink: "/personas/{{ agent.id }}/"
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ agent.name }}"
  category: "Personas · {{ agent.name }}"
  lede: "{{ agent.role | safe }}"
  ogImage: "{{ agent.socialImage }}"
  ogImageAlt: "{{ agent.name }}: {{ agent.role | safe }}"
  ogImageWidth: 1200
  ogImageHeight: 630
  updated: "{{ agent.updated }}"
layout: page
section: personas
---

{% if agent.image %}
<figure class="agent-portrait">
  <img src="{{ agent.image | url }}" alt="{{ agent.imageAlt | escape }}" width="{{ agent.imageWidth }}" height="{{ agent.imageHeight }}" decoding="async">
</figure>
{% endif %}

<dl class="agent-facts" id="record" aria-label="At a glance">
  <div><dt>Version</dt><dd><a href="{{ agent.releaseUrl }}">{{ agent.version }}</a></dd></div>
  <div><dt>Audit</dt><dd>{{ agent.audit.passed }}/{{ agent.audit.total }} suites</dd></div>
  <div><dt>Updated</dt><dd><time datetime="{{ agent.updated }}">{{ agent.updated }}</time></dd></div>
</dl>

<h2 id="who">{{ agent.heading }} <a class="heading-anchor" href="#who" aria-label="Permalink to {{ agent.heading }}">#</a></h2>

{% for paragraph in agent.paragraphs %}
<p>{{ paragraph }}</p>
{% endfor %}

<p class="agent-ask"><strong>Knowledgeable in:</strong> {{ agent.consult }}</p>

<h2 id="words">In their own words <a class="heading-anchor" href="#words" aria-label="Permalink to In their own words">#</a></h2>

<p class="muted">Every sample below is checked against the library by the site
gate; it is a verified line, not a paraphrase.</p>

<div class="quote-grid">
{% for sample in agent.samples %}
<figure class="agent-quote">
  <blockquote><p>{{ sample.text | escape }}</p></blockquote>
  <figcaption>{{ agent.name }}, {{ sample.context | escape }}</figcaption>
</figure>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<h2 id="test-tapes">Test tapes <a class="heading-anchor" href="#test-tapes" aria-label="Permalink to Test tapes">#</a></h2>

<p class="muted">{{ voices | bySpeaker(agent.name) | length }} exchanges generated by {{ agent.name }}'s own agent: dialogue, not
canon quotes. <a href="{{ '/' | url }}#tapes">Random picks live on the home page.</a></p>

<ul class="tape-list">
  {% for tape in voices | bySpeaker(agent.name) %}
  <li class="tape">
    <p class="tape-prompt">{{ tape.prompt | escape }}</p>
    <blockquote><p>{{ tape.text | escape }}</p></blockquote>
    <span class="tape-topic">{{ tape.topic | escape }}</span>
  </li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="limits">What they won't do <a class="heading-anchor" href="#limits" aria-label="Permalink to What they won't do">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  {% for limit in agent.limits %}
  <li>{{ limit | escape }}</li>
  {% endfor %}
</ul>

<h2 id="setup">Eyes up <a class="heading-anchor" href="#setup" aria-label="Permalink to Eyes up">#</a></h2>

<p>Download the character, then run its setup script to connect the library. The
first line downloads the project, the second enters its folder, and the third
connects the library:</p>

<pre><code>git clone {{ agent.repo }}.git
cd {{ agent.repoName }}
./setup.sh</code></pre>

<p>To set it up without questions, run <code>BOOTSTRAP=1 ./setup.sh</code>. If you
use OpenCode or OpenClaw, the
<a href="{{ '/personas/install/' | url }}">install page</a> has a one-step setup.</p>

<h2 id="for-experts">For Experts (or enthusiasts) <a class="heading-anchor" href="#for-experts" aria-label="Permalink to For Experts (or enthusiasts)">#</a></h2>

<p class="muted">The entry file, the audit and the repository links.</p>

<h3 id="entry-file">The brain <a class="heading-anchor" href="#entry-file" aria-label="Permalink to The brain">#</a></h3>

<p>In OpenCode, <code>{{ agent.entry }}</code> is the main entry file. Anything that
reads <code>AGENTS.md</code> can use the repository directly. The file is where the
voice, the guardrails and the archive pointers begin.</p>

<p><a href="{{ agent.entryUrl or agent.repo }}">Read {{ agent.entry }} on GitHub</a>.</p>

<p>Series deployment also installs a read-only consult copy,
<code>{{ agent.id }}-consult.md</code>, so another persona can ask a question without
getting write access to this one's files.</p>

<h3 id="checks">The audit <a class="heading-anchor" href="#checks" aria-label="Permalink to The audit">#</a></h3>

<pre><code>bash tests/master-audit.sh</code></pre>

<p>{{ agent.audit.passed }}/{{ agent.audit.total }} suites pass on the current
release. The audit checks voice, quotes, module coverage, the conversation path
and the shared structure gates. It is the same suite CI runs.</p>

<h3 id="repository">The source <a class="heading-anchor" href="#repository" aria-label="Permalink to The source">#</a></h3>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}">{{ agent.repoName }}</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/blob/master/README.md">README</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ agent.repo }}/issues">Issues</a></li>
</ul>

<h2 id="next">Next <a class="heading-anchor" href="#next" aria-label="Permalink to Next">#</a></h2>

<ul>
  <li><a href="{{ '/personas/' | url }}">Back to the characters</a></li>
  {% for other in agents %}{% if other.id != agent.id %}
  <li><a href="{{ ('/personas/' + other.id + '/') | url }}">Meet {{ other.name }}</a></li>
  {% endif %}{% endfor %}
  <li><a href="{{ '/personas/build/' | url }}">Add another persona</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/personas/install/' | url }}">Deploy into OpenCode or OpenClaw</a></li>
  <li><a href="{{ '/personas/platforms/' | url }}">Integrations</a></li>
</ul>
